{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover a post-apocalyptic Earth where Humanity has been replaced by Crinchures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/extras/57840ada0fd8c9b66322e56da5afb28d.webp?t=1768747823\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/extras/146423eca5534a67ff0fd0d5181cc720.webp?t=1768747823\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has its own unique Crinchures, along with Swords (for some reason?), ingredients (for baking!), and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new Crinchures, see new places, bake treats, hang out with your new buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe you'll even trigger an apocalypse of your own, who knows?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decisions, Decisions, Decisions...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you approach the Crinchures?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the best treat to get that Crinchure I'm missing?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which Swords will you Enshrine?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you hunt for Superdope, special and shiny Crinchures? or just take whatever you can get?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Crinchures, Swords, Ingredients, and more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo provides access to the first 2 Areas (of 5!) and allows you to find the following collectables:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >83*2 = 166 Crinchures (out of 500+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 swords (out of 130+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 ingredients (out of 270+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and even more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? <strong><i>QUEST</i></strong> mode will challenge you to save your partner before they succumb to a terrible virus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just wanna collect stuff? <i>vibes</i> mode is for you! No time limit, no stress - just enjoy the vibes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713980?t=1768747823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713980?t=1768747823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/8f1fac7b8d9871da4e5659f4a26b36290e006efb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768747823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/8f1fac7b8d9871da4e5659f4a26b36290e006efb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768747823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4091960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover a post-apocalyptic Earth where Humanity has been replaced by Crinchures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/extras/57840ada0fd8c9b66322e56da5afb28d.webp?t=1768747823\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/extras/146423eca5534a67ff0fd0d5181cc720.webp?t=1768747823\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has its own unique Crinchures, along with Swords (for some reason?), ingredients (for baking!), and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new Crinchures, see new places, bake treats, hang out with your new buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe you'll even trigger an apocalypse of your own, who knows?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decisions, Decisions, Decisions...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you approach the Crinchures?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the best treat to get that Crinchure I'm missing?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which Swords will you Enshrine?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you hunt for Superdope, special and shiny Crinchures? or just take whatever you can get?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Crinchures, Swords, Ingredients, and more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo provides access to the first 2 Areas (of 5!) and allows you to find the following collectables:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >83*2 = 166 Crinchures (out of 500+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 swords (out of 130+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 ingredients (out of 270+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and even more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? <strong><i>QUEST</i></strong> mode will challenge you to save your partner before they succumb to a terrible virus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just wanna collect stuff? <i>vibes</i> mode is for you! No time limit, no stress - just enjoy the vibes!</p>","developers":["Blushing Kitsune Basket"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713980/d7b2e59def2723a61d267760b1467e5025e56cf4/header.jpg?t=1768747823","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713980/2121022367/6d783578f30f57428a56cb38f97c1de7c1119337/1760366671/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760367524","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713980/2121022367/6d783578f30f57428